(text "S3 MOTION LOGGER  -  Rev A" (at 30.48 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 3.0 3.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid dff04b07-8ef4-49c8-b154-ab45ea839fc9))
(text "ESP32-S3 motion logger: logs 6-axis IMU data up to 1 kHz to microSD and streams over USB, BLE or Wi-Fi.\nRuns from a 1S LiPo, charges over USB-C with power path.  Board target: ~45 x 30 mm, 4 layers, 1.6 mm." (at 30.48 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 97bfae00-49e5-44f2-8ce8-53c8a8c95f1c))
(text "POWER TREE\nUSB-C VBUS --> BQ24074 (power path, 500 mA charge) --> VSYS (3.0 - 4.4 V)\n                     |                                   |\n                   VBAT <--> 1S LiPo (P-FET reverse protect) --> TPS63802 buck-boost --> +3V3 (600 mA budget)\n\n3V3 BUDGET: ESP32-S3 ~350 mA peak (Wi-Fi TX), microSD ~100 mA peak, IMU ~1 mA, misc ~5 mA  =>  ~460 mA peak\n\nSTACKUP (JLC 4-layer): L1 signal+parts | L2 solid GND | L3 3V3/power pours | L4 signal + GND fill\nUSB D+/D- routed as 90 ohm differential pair.  Antenna end of U4 at board edge, keep-out on all layers." (at 30.48 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid 917f44cc-0c2e-4bdb-b68c-27e1be9173f9))
